WEBVTT

00:07.270 --> 00:08.770
Come on, Kathy!

00:09.610 --> 00:12.270
Oh, honestly! Stop that, Johnny!

00:12.700 --> 00:14.080
Come on! Come on!

00:21.580 --> 00:22.610
Take that!

00:23.010 --> 00:24.210
Now you've done it!

00:25.830 --> 00:27.370
What's wrong?

00:27.710 --> 00:29.050
Don't do that, Kathy.

00:29.050 --> 00:32.490
There should be no secrets between us.

