01:01.240 --> 01:06.120
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

02:13.980 --> 02:16.910
<b>Episode 11</b>

02:13.980 --> 02:16.910
Shark From Another World

02:17.180 --> 02:20.490
This is the quest we want you 
to take on this time, Asahi-kun.

02:20.870 --> 02:22.870
A shark hunt?!

02:22.870 --> 02:23.950
That's right!

02:24.680 --> 02:25.700
Shark?

02:25.700 --> 02:28.330
You mean the rowdy ocean creatures?

02:28.330 --> 02:32.710
Yup, yup. There have been a number of injuries
 from shark attacks on Lupercalia Beach.

02:32.710 --> 02:37.080
I see. This does seem like something 
the Super Asahi Legion should tackle.

02:37.610 --> 02:41.720
But a shark doesn't even compare 
to things like wyverns and orcs, right?

02:41.720 --> 02:44.390
You just don't get it, Maya-nee.

02:44.390 --> 02:46.470
Never underestimate a shark!

02:46.470 --> 02:49.350
Sharks are the progenitors 
of the "monster panic" movie!

02:49.350 --> 02:50.880
Naturally, they're a threat in the water,

02:49.350 --> 03:00.610
Loves watching B movies

02:50.880 --> 02:53.600
but lately, they've been dropped
 on urban areas by tornadoes,

02:53.600 --> 02:57.510
had multiple heads, and been turned into robots,
all so they can unleash their fury on land, too!

02:57.510 --> 03:00.610
Wow. Modern sharks have evolved that much?

03:00.610 --> 03:03.010
Plus, we're in another world,

03:03.010 --> 03:05.790
so we don't know what kind of
 amazing shark might appear.

03:05.790 --> 03:08.620
I see. But if we go, 
it should be just the two of us.

03:09.020 --> 03:12.850
What? I mean, if you're there, 
I'm sure we'll be fine, but...

03:12.850 --> 03:14.660
The ocean means swimsuits.

03:15.340 --> 03:18.740
And swimsuits means rubbing sunscreen 
on Asahi, and him rubbing it on me.

03:18.740 --> 03:19.770
Slurp.

03:19.770 --> 03:21.380
Okay, let's go. Let's go right now!

03:21.380 --> 03:23.290
Your motives are way too impure!

03:24.670 --> 03:26.140
Wow!

03:26.480 --> 03:27.890
It's so vast!

03:29.320 --> 03:31.360
The ocean's so pretty, isn't it?

03:31.360 --> 03:33.060
And the weather's lovely, too.

03:33.350 --> 03:34.950
Why are all of you here?

03:34.950 --> 03:37.940
We have Mister Asahi's movements
 under constant surveillance,

03:37.940 --> 03:39.900
so we took the liberty 
of arriving before you.

03:40.380 --> 03:44.160
Today is the day I will make my 
relationship with Asahi a romantic one!

03:44.490 --> 03:49.250
It is my duty to accompany the 
Exalted Hero wherever he goes.

03:49.250 --> 03:53.590
She came in this morning and made a huge fuss, 
saying, "The Exalted Hero has disappeared!"

03:53.590 --> 03:56.170
So I had no choice. I took a paid 
day off and brought her here.

03:56.440 --> 03:58.290
Th-Thanks for going to the trouble.

03:58.290 --> 04:02.810
And since I'm here, I get to watch you
 do your work up close, Asahi-kun.

04:03.770 --> 04:05.010
I'll do my best.

04:05.660 --> 04:10.140
If everyone was gonna come anyway, 
maybe we should've invited Kilmaria.

04:10.140 --> 04:13.620
That idiot was sleeping like 
a log and refused to wake up.

04:14.050 --> 04:19.150
Everyone, I have two announcements
 to make, one happy, one sad.

04:19.150 --> 04:21.370
Which would you like to hear first?

04:22.630 --> 04:25.060
I-I guess start with the sad one?

04:25.380 --> 04:26.660
Very well.

04:27.160 --> 04:29.830
This is the saddening information.

04:31.350 --> 04:38.090
<b>Quest Complete!</b>

04:32.200 --> 04:36.240
They attacked as we arrived, 
so we couldn't help it.

04:36.240 --> 04:38.090
<i>That's Miss Musclebrain for you.</i>

04:38.430 --> 04:41.540
Which means there's nothing 
left for us to do here?

04:41.540 --> 04:45.340
Looks that way. The Super Asahi League
 is definitely to be feared.

04:45.910 --> 04:47.800
So what's the happy news?

04:47.170 --> 04:47.800
Eep!

04:48.060 --> 04:50.260
We can play in the ocean 
to our heart's content.

04:52.190 --> 04:54.180
I'm glad I came!

04:54.180 --> 04:55.990
Is this really all right, though?

04:56.300 --> 04:58.020
Why not, every once in a while?

04:58.020 --> 05:00.010
We can unwind a little.

05:02.730 --> 05:03.740
That's true.

05:04.020 --> 05:06.860
Well, since we're here, let's take the day off.

05:06.860 --> 05:07.890
Yeah!

05:07.890 --> 05:08.650
However...

05:09.530 --> 05:12.700
Your current attire is 
unsuitable for the beach.

05:13.200 --> 05:16.080
Which is why I have brought 
you all a change of clothes.

05:16.080 --> 05:18.000
Aren't you a little <i>too</i> prepared?

05:24.970 --> 05:26.580
U-Um...

05:27.350 --> 05:30.210
For some reason, 
I feel incredibly embarrassed.

05:30.210 --> 05:32.680
I was told this was what 
you liked, Exalted Hero.

05:32.680 --> 05:36.860
No, no, no! A school swimsuit in 
another world? My taste isn't that niche!

05:37.670 --> 05:41.040
We match. Or so it seems, but we don't really.

05:41.040 --> 05:42.800
Both old <i>and</i> new styles?!

05:43.180 --> 05:45.820
We had them made to order.

05:45.820 --> 05:50.320
G-Guess I should've expected that from the
super-rich Brigandine family's technology.

05:51.060 --> 05:54.110
Huh? Maya-nee, you're not gonna change?

05:54.110 --> 05:58.940
I was shocked. This looks like my regular 
clothes, but it's made of swimsuit material.

05:58.940 --> 06:02.640
Huh? I mean, it's true you usually
 show a lot of skin, but...

06:02.640 --> 06:04.950
We had it made to order.

06:04.950 --> 06:08.960
<i>I'm not sure if it's the Brigandine family
 that's amazing or this person.</i>

06:10.080 --> 06:12.710
It is now time for the 
star of the show to appear!

06:17.520 --> 06:19.730
Wh-What do you think?

06:22.460 --> 06:24.560
It suits you very well, mistress.

06:24.560 --> 06:25.960
Doesn't it, Mister Asahi?

06:25.960 --> 06:28.220
Huh? U-Uh, yeah.

06:28.220 --> 06:30.080
I think it looks good on you.

06:30.080 --> 06:32.700
Th-Thank you.

06:34.470 --> 06:37.070
In this, Mister Asahi's gaze
 will only be on you.

06:37.070 --> 06:40.390
Well done, Kuon. Splendid work.

06:43.920 --> 06:45.670
Hello, everyone.

06:45.670 --> 06:49.170
I am Asahi-kun's companion, Maria, and I—

06:51.430 --> 06:54.430
What's this all of a sudden, sister?

06:54.780 --> 06:58.930
What are you wearing? Have you no shame?
You're being a bad influence on Asahi!

06:59.190 --> 07:03.090
<i>Y-You're</i> the one person 
I don't want to hear that from!

07:03.090 --> 07:03.900
Exalted Hero!

07:03.900 --> 07:04.710
Whoa!

07:04.710 --> 07:07.560
Is what this outrageous person said true?

07:07.560 --> 07:10.400
Asahi-kun, is that the 
kind of thing you're into?

07:10.400 --> 07:11.930
I-It's not like that.

07:11.930 --> 07:16.660
She's Maya-nee's, uh, friend, I guess?

07:17.830 --> 07:20.420
I don't think I can compete with that.

07:20.420 --> 07:23.590
Besides which, she can 
completely block Maya-san's attacks.

07:23.590 --> 07:25.420
She is no average person.

07:25.420 --> 07:28.420
Indeed. She is definitely not "average."

07:28.850 --> 07:31.850
There is no helping it. 
We will switch to plan B.

07:34.810 --> 07:36.140
What's this?

07:36.140 --> 07:38.730
It's hardly any different 
from what I usually wear.

07:38.730 --> 07:40.820
It already has more than enough impact!

07:40.820 --> 07:41.390
Tch.

07:41.730 --> 07:44.730
Really? You're welcome to take a closer look.

07:44.730 --> 07:46.700
She's way more dangerous than a shark.

07:45.380 --> 07:47.560
Come on. Come on.

07:46.700 --> 07:48.150
Asahi!

07:48.150 --> 07:50.370
We're about to start!

07:50.370 --> 07:51.650
What's all this?

07:51.650 --> 07:53.290
The Asahi Scramble!

07:53.290 --> 07:56.920
We're holding a three-game
summer beach sports competition!

07:56.920 --> 07:58.230
What does that even mean?

07:58.230 --> 08:00.370
As the name implies, 
the winner gets a voucher

08:00.370 --> 08:03.310
that says Mister Asahi must 
do one thing of their choosing.

08:03.310 --> 08:04.070
What?

08:04.070 --> 08:05.520
Oh? Sounds interesting.

08:05.520 --> 08:07.040
Wait! Don't I get a say?!

08:07.040 --> 08:08.880
This is good! This is good!

08:08.880 --> 08:13.050
I can use it to have a dreamy night
 alone on the beach with Asahi.

08:13.050 --> 08:18.180
I'd take a mold of the Exalted Hero and 
use it to make statues to place around town!

08:18.970 --> 08:21.220
Nothing good can possibly come of this!

08:21.220 --> 08:24.690
It is meant to foster greater unity.
 I ask for your understanding.

08:25.230 --> 08:27.920
It feels like they're ready to battle hard!

08:27.920 --> 08:31.440
I'd expect no less. A pro always
 gives it everything they've got.

08:31.440 --> 08:33.450
Now then, let us begin.

09:00.750 --> 09:02.260
You can do it!

09:05.270 --> 09:06.900
Go for it, Sophie!

09:21.700 --> 09:23.700
<b>Results</b>

09:29.460 --> 09:30.650
Naturally!

09:29.560 --> 09:32.090
<b>Maya</b>

09:32.930 --> 09:35.870
Maya-nee, no matter what you're 
made to do, you're always good at it.

09:35.870 --> 09:40.140
Well, when the prize is you, Asahi, 
I have to do my very best as your big sister.

09:40.140 --> 09:42.430
Asahi! Hurry up and do me, too.

09:42.430 --> 09:44.120
Do it yourself.

09:44.120 --> 09:46.350
No fair. You're hogging Asahi.

09:50.610 --> 09:52.150
It can't be...

09:56.400 --> 10:00.780
Are you the ones who 
brutally slaughtered my brethren?

10:01.210 --> 10:03.790
They were in our way, 
so we removed them, that's all.

10:03.790 --> 10:07.930
You... This grudge must be settled!

10:10.540 --> 10:11.920
Fire!

10:11.920 --> 10:12.580
Stone!

10:12.580 --> 10:13.840
Phantom!

10:13.840 --> 10:17.760
<b>Angel Shark</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:17.760
<b>Boxer Shark</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:17.800
<b>Shark Man</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:21.260
<b>Shark Tuber</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:21.260
<b>VR Shark</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:22.970
<b>Blue Shark</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:22.970
<b>Fire Shark</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:22.970
<b>Red Orca</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:22.970
<b>Sexy Shark</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:22.970
<b>Phantom Shark</b>

10:13.840 --> 10:22.970
<b>Stone Shark</b>

10:14.090 --> 10:15.420
And the rest!

10:15.420 --> 10:18.200
We are the Sea King's Ten Greatest!

10:17.780 --> 10:22.970
<b>The Sea King's Ten Greatest</b>

10:21.260 --> 10:22.730
Isn't there one too many?

10:22.730 --> 10:24.140
Let's go!

10:26.340 --> 10:29.430
Big Sis Blizzard!

10:29.430 --> 10:30.100
Sha?

10:39.070 --> 10:42.820
Crimson Blaze!

10:44.580 --> 10:46.450
Stone!

10:48.580 --> 10:50.130
Huh? What?

10:50.130 --> 10:53.250
Wait, does that mean 
I'm taking care of this ghost one?

10:54.810 --> 10:56.170
Flash!

10:56.170 --> 10:58.630
T-Too bright!

10:58.940 --> 11:00.580
Th-That was close.

11:00.580 --> 11:01.740
You did it, Asahi.

11:01.740 --> 11:03.330
That's AmazAsa for you!

11:06.030 --> 11:11.450
Carve the names of Gloria Brigandine and 
her servant, Kuon, into your very beings!

11:12.500 --> 11:14.580
Stone Lightning Blossom, Six Strikes.

11:15.190 --> 11:18.610
Graceful Strike!

11:24.700 --> 11:26.240
I-Incredible.

11:26.700 --> 11:29.180
W-We need to at least take down one of them!

11:33.860 --> 11:34.800
Asahi?

11:44.480 --> 11:46.970
Asahi!

